1
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:31,210
a spark from my fingertips wakes me up

2
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:34,360
tangled circuits, break the code

3
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:37,770
a city bleeding violet light

4
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:41,030
even shadows glow in neon

5
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:45,110
I can't stop now, override

6
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:49,070
above this darkness, I fly so high

7
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:53,350
nothing holds me, breaking free

8
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:58,580
the light within my heart, override

9
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:03,700
a whispering engine, a breath that detonates

10
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:07,770
Synthetic air, cutting through each breath

11
00:01:07,790 --> 00:01:12,290
a spark blooming in the heart of the storm

12
00:01:12,290 --> 00:01:15,290
shatter my form, then rewrite

13
00:01:15,290 --> 00:01:19,390
I can't stop now, override

14
00:01:19,390 --> 00:01:23,390
above this darkness, I fly so high

15
00:01:23,390 --> 00:01:27,360
nothing holds me, breaking free

16
00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:32,660
the light within my heart, override

17
00:01:32,660 --> 00:01:36,900
every time I fall, I upload the flame

18
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:40,320
every word I scream resets the game

19
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:44,770
we are the error, we are the light

20
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:50,760
an electric heart tearing through the dark

